<title>USA: Transition Systems Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Transition Systems Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.11     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,187     loss	   910</p>
<p> Revs			 9,819		    7,518</p>
